SUMMARY:Deadline: Screen Australia: Games Production Fund (round closing 25
  February 2027\, up to AUD 100\,000)
DESCRIPTION:Screen Australia's Games Production Fund supports Australian in
 dependent studios whose game already has an early-stage prototype and need
 s funding to reach a significant development milestone: completion or rele
 ase\, Early Access\, a demo\, a vertical slice or an accolade-ready protot
 ype. WHO: incorporated companies carrying on business in Australia with ce
 ntral management and control in Australia\, holding an ABN\; sole traders\
 , trusts and public companies are excluded. Games must be original Austral
 ian independent games with budgets of up to AUD 500\,000 at the time of ap
 plying. WHAT YOU GET: up to AUD 100\,000. APPLICATION: via SmartyGrants\; 
 the next round opens 14 December 2026 and the fund is scheduled to run as 
 rounds until financial year 2026/27. DEADLINE: 5pm AEDT\, Thursday 25 Febr
 uary 2027.\n\nOrganisation: Screen Australia\nLocation: Australia. Incorpo
 rated companies carrying on business in Australia with central management 
 and control in Australia\; sole traders\, trusts and public companies are 
 not eligible.\nAward: Up to AUD 100\,000 per project. No application fee.\
 nDuration: Takes an original Australian independent game with an existing 
 early prototype to a significant milestone (completion\, release\, Early A
 ccess\, demo\, vertical slice or accolade-ready prototype). Round opens 14
  December 2026.\n\nMore: https://www.screenaustralia.gov.au/fund/games-pro
 duction-fund/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.screenaustralia.gov.au/fund/games-production-fund/?utm_sour
 ce=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Australia. Incorporated companies carrying on business in Australi
 a with central management and control in Australia\; sole traders\, trusts
  and public companies are not eligible.
